{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — gentle aromatherapy experiences that may support everyday balance." />
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fcfbf7;--card:#fff;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#7b5cff;--accent-2:#ff9f7b;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);--shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(19,19,24,0.06);--radius:14px;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fbf8ff);color:#111;line-height:1.4}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),rgba(255,255,255,0.4));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.04);z-index:40}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}
    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
    .brand{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    .navlinks{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:12px}
    .navlinks a{color:#222;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
    .navlinks a:hover{background:rgba(123,92,255,0.08)}
    main{padding:40px 20px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:28px}
    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:26px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.06;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;mix-blend-mode:multiply}
    h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}
    .contact-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:14px}
    .pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(123,92,255,0.12),rgba(255,159,123,0.06));font-weight:600}

    /* Diagnostic / Mood-to-Method */
    .diagnostic{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;margin-bottom:22px}
    .moods{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
    .mood{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,var(--glass));border-radius:12px;padding:12px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);min-width:120px;text-align:center}
    .mood.active{outline:3px solid rgba(123,92,255,0.12);transform:translateY(-4px)}
    .recommend{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),#fff);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .recommend h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px}
    .recommend p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}
    .cta-primary{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff;padding:8px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .switch{width:46px;height:28px;background:#f1f1ff;border-radius:999px;position:relative;padding:3px}
    .knob{width:22px;height:22px;background:white;border-radius:50%;position:absolute;left:3px;top:3px;transition:left .28s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .switch.on{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2))}
    .switch.on .knob{left:21px}
    .price-card{padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:160px}
    .price{font-size:24px;font-weight:800}
    .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:grid;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.06);font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
    button[type="submit"]{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff;border:none;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}
    .muted{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* FAQ and foot */
    .faq{display:grid;gap:10px}
    .faq-item{background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    footer{margin-top:36px;padding:20px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media(max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .diagnostic{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .navlinks{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav>
        <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class="navlinks">
          <a href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
          <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
          <a href="shop.html">Store</a>
          <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
          <a href="about.html">Story</a>
          <a href="book.html">Book</a>
          <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="pattern" aria-hidden></div>
        <h1>Say hello — let's shape your next calm minute</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach out for consultations, bespoke blends, or a friendly chat about scent approaches that may support clearer moments.</p>
        <div class="contact-meta">
          <div class="pill">Call: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>
          <div class="pill">Email: <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>
          <div class="muted">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h3>Quick note</h3>
          <p class="muted">If you are reaching out about pregnancy, pets, or sensitive skin, please mention it. We prioritize gentle, safety-forward suggestions that may support wellbeing.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <a class="cta-primary" href="book.html">Schedule a conversation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- Diagnostic: Mood-to-Method -->
    <section class="diagnostic">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0">Mood-to-Method selector</h2>
        <p class="muted">Pick what you feel now; we’ll shape a scent-forward approach and a suggested first step.</p>
        <div class="moods" id="moodList">
          <div class="mood" data-key="tense">Tense</div>
          <div class="mood" data-key="foggy">Mentally Foggy</div>
          <div class="mood" data-key="sleepy">Sleepy</div>
          <div class="mood" data-key="flat">Flat & Low</div>
          <div class="mood" data-key="spark">I want uplift</div>
        </div>
        <div style="height:12px"></div>
        <div class="recommend" id="recommendArea">
          <h3 id="recTitle">Choose a state above</h3>
          <p id="recCopy">We’ll offer a careful suggestion and a clear next step—no medical promises, only practical scent-led options that may support balance.</p>
          <a id="recCta" class="cta-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Pricing comparator</h3>
          <p class="muted">Toggle between Monthly support and One-time curated packages. Numbers animate so you can feel the shift.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:14px">
            <div class="toggle">
              <div class="switch" id="priceSwitch" role="button" aria-pressed="false">
                <div class="knob"></div>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-left:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Monthly / Package</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="height:14px"></div>
          <div class="pricing">
            <div class="price-card" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="muted">Personal Support</div>
              <div class="price" data-month="79" data-package="220">$79</div>
              <div class="note">Per month or one-time package</div>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="muted">Bespoke Blend</div>
              <div class="price" data-month="35" data-package="95">$35</div>
              <div class="note">Per bottle or kit</div>
            </div>
            <div class="price-card" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="muted">Short Session</div>
              <div class="price" data-month="49" data-package="140">$49</div>
              <div class="note">Single consult or trio pack</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">Pricing framed as helpful guidance. Selected option is reflected in the booking flow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact form + mini mood check -->
    <section style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px;margin-bottom:26px">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0">Send a note</h2>
        <p class="muted">Tell us what you’re after—custom blends, safety questions, or to set up a short consult.</p>
        <form id="contactForm">
          <div class="row">
            <input name="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
            <input name="email" placeholder="Email" required />
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" />
            <select name="interest">
              <option value="consult">Consult</option>
              <option value="blend">Custom Blend</option>
              <option value="retail">Retail Purchase</option>
              <option value="question">Question / Safety</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <!-- mini Mood-to-Method -->
          <label class="muted">Quick mood check</label>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px">
            <button type="button" class="mood" data-key="tense">Tense</button>
            <button type="button" class="mood" data-key="sleepy">Sleepy</button>
          </div>

          <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us a bit — what would you like to explore? (Include any pregnancy/pet notes if relevant)"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <button type="submit">Send message</button>
            <div class="muted">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div id="formStatus" class="muted" style="margin-top:8px"></div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">FAQ — Safety & guidance</h3>
        <div class="faq">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <strong>Dilution & patch testing</strong>
            <p class="muted">Always dilute essential oils for topical use. We recommend a patch test: dilute to suggested proportions and wait 24 hours. Our sessions provide clear dilution guidance that may support gentle use.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <strong>Pets</strong>
            <p class="muted">Many oils are not recommended around companion animals. Mention the species and sensitivity and we will suggest pet-aware options that place safety first.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <strong>Pregnancy & nursing</strong>
            <p class="muted">If pregnant or nursing, tell us before receiving guidance. We will offer safety-first ideas and will avoid any strong or contraindicated suggestions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <strong>Medical disclaimers</strong>
            <p class="muted">Aromatherapy may support ordinary wellbeing for some people, but it is not a substitute for medical care. We do not make therapeutic claims.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div class="muted">&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — a careful approach to scent that may support balance.</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
          <a href="privacy.html" class="muted">Privacy</a>
          <a href="about.html" class="muted">About</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Mood-to-Method data
    const methods = {
      tense: {
        title: 'Ease & lengthen',
        copy: 'A breathing-focused approach with gentle, grounding citrus and woody notes. We suggest a short 10-minute inhalation practice and a dilute chest rub if appropriate.',
        cta: 'Book a short ease session'
      },
      foggy: {
        title: 'Clarity lift',
        copy: 'Bright, cooling aromatics that may support alertness—diffusion for focused windows, plus an aromatic roller for quick refreshes.',
        cta: 'Try a clarity consult'
      },
      sleepy: {
        title: 'Gentle unwinding',
        copy: 'Soft, floral and balsamic notes to cue rest. We’ll suggest a bedside mist and an evening ritual that may support sleep rhythm without claims of cure.',
        cta: 'Explore wind-down options'
      },
      flat: {
        title: 'Slow lift',
        copy: 'Warm, spicy and bright accords designed to nudge energy in small steps—short scent moments that may support a gentle mood lift.',
        cta: 'Start a slow-lift plan'
      },
      spark: {
        title: 'Uplift & move',
        copy: 'Vibrant citrus and green notes paired with movement cues. A single-use blend and a micro-habit to anchor the feeling are usually helpful.',
        cta: 'Create an uplift blend'
      }
    };

    // Mood selector (main)
    const moodList = document.getElementById('moodList');
    const recTitle = document.getElementById('recTitle');
    const recCopy = document.getElementById('recCopy');
    const recCta = document.getElementById('recCta');

    moodList.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      const el = e.target.closest('.mood');
      if (!el) return;
      [...moodList.querySelectorAll('.mood')].forEach(m=>m.classList.remove('active'));
      el.classList.add('active');
      applyMood(el.dataset.key);
    });

    // Mini mood buttons in form
    document.querySelectorAll('form .mood').forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        applyMood(btn.dataset.key);
        // reflect choice visually
        document.querySelectorAll('form .mood').forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
      });
    });

    function applyMood(key){
      const m = methods[key];
      if (!m) return;
      recTitle.textContent = m.title;
      recCopy.textContent = m.copy;
      recCta.textContent = m.cta;
      // personalize CTA URL with query if available
      const base = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
      recCta.href = base + (base.indexOf('?')>-1 ? '&' : '?') + 'mood=' + encodeURIComponent(key);
    }

    // Pricing comparator logic with animated numbers
    const switchEl = document.getElementById('priceSwitch');
    let isPackage = false;
    switchEl.addEventListener('click', () => {
      isPackage = !isPackage;
      switchEl.classList.toggle('on', isPackage);
      switchEl.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(isPackage));
      document.querySelectorAll('.price').forEach(el => animatePrice(el, isPackage ? 'data-package' : 'data-month'));
    });

    function animatePrice(el, attr){
      const start = parseInt(el.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''),10) || 0;
      const end = parseInt(el.getAttribute(attr),10) || start;
      const duration = 420;
      const startTime = performance.now();
      const sign = end >= start ? 1 : -1;
      function frame(now){
        const t = Math.min(1,(now - startTime)/duration);
        // easeOutCubic
        const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);
        const val = Math.round(start + (end - start) * eased);
        el.textContent = '$' + val;
        if (t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(frame);
    }

    // Initialize prices to monthly values
    document.querySelectorAll('.price').forEach(el => {
      const m = el.getAttribute('data-month');
      el.textContent = '$' + (m || '0');
    });

    // Contact form submit (mock)
    const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const status = document.getElementById('formStatus');
      status.textContent = 'Sending...';
      // simple simulated send
      setTimeout(() => {
        status.textContent = 'Thanks — your message has been received. We will reply at ' + (form.email.value || '{{EMAIL}}') + '.';
        form.reset();
      }, 900);
    });

    // Accessibility: allow keyboard toggle on switch
    switchEl.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); switchEl.click(); }});
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains two files for the aromatherapy site (layoutFamily: lux_gallery, voice: warm_storyteller).

Files included:
- contact.html — the contact page with interactive tools:
  - Mood-to-Method selector: choose a current state; the recommended approach and CTA text update live. The main selector appears in the diagnostic section and a mini selector is included in the contact form.
  - Pricing Comparator: a local toggle (Monthly ↔ Package) with animated numbers for each price card. Implemented with vanilla JS and requestAnimationFrame.
  - Contact form: mock submit behavior (no external backend); status message shown after a simulated delay.
  - Safety-forward FAQ: dilution, patch testing, pets, pregnancy notes (uses "may support" language and no medical claims).

Notes:
- Placeholders used in the templates: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Replace as needed.
- No external assets or CDNs. The page references a local SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for background texture; ensure that file appears in another chunk of the project.
- Navigation uses a different label set and correct links to the site pages (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html).

Testing:
- Open contact.html in a browser. Click mood cards to see the recommendation and CTA update (CTA URL will append a mood query). Toggle the pricing switch to animate price changes.
- The form simulates sending and shows a confirmation message; adapt the submit handler to your backend endpoint when ready.

Accessibility & behavior:
- Switch supports Enter/Space keyboard activation.
- Price cards are announced via aria-live when toggled.

Design & constraints:
- Safety-forward aromatherapy copy; no medical claims. Include dilution/patch test/pets/pregnancy guidance in the FAQ.
- This chunk does not include the SVG asset; include assets/img/pattern.svg elsewhere in the repository to match the CSS reference.

If you need the complementary assets (pattern.svg) or additional pages from this project, ask for the next chunk."}
BUNDLE_END
